## The deal that is stuck

A large travel-management company wants to roll Wanda out to its corporate travelers. Its security questionnaire asks who can access guest data, where model calls go, how actions are approved, how quality is measured, and how long records are kept. Today the support team cannot answer any of it. That is your job.

